<h1>BSP-tree</h1>
<p>
(data structure)
</p>

<p>
<strong>Definition:</strong>
A binary space partitioning (BSP) tree is a <a href="binarytree.html"><em>binary tree</em></a> for multidimensional points where successive levels are split by arbitrary hyperplanes.
</p>

<p>
<strong>See also</strong>
<a href="pointAccessMethod.html"><em>point access method</em></a>, <a href="quadtree.html"><em>quadtree</em></a>, <a href="octree.html"><em>octree</em></a>.
</p>

<p>
<em>Note:
After <a href="../terms.html#GG98">[GG98]</a>.</em>
</p>

<p>Author: <a href="../Other/contrib.html#authorPEB">PEB</a></p>

<hr>

